blocks.en:
System prompt: Video Watch this video. Reference caption: “ { original_text } ”. Write a
dense description covering: subjects and setting; spatial layout;
the temporal sequence of events (what happens first, next, last);
camera motion or shot transitions; on-screen actions; any text or
captions visible on screen. One paragraph.

